WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.120
The good thing about these social amoeba is
if you think — if you have a hypothesis

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.339
you can test it at the genetic level.

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:09.090
You can knock out genes.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:15.240
You can look at exactly what’s going on
at a very mechanistic level, bringing evolutionary

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:23.560
biology together with the very most mechanistic,
cellular and biochemical biology.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:29.640
So this is really what makes it such a great
system for studying the importance of cooperation

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.109
and the evolution of life.

